{"id":"n25377-1-13","stage":3,"title":"초기 · 初期","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25377-1-13-1","ko":"너희 어머니 아프시다더니 괜찮아?","zh":"听说你们妈妈生病了，现在好点了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"어머니","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}},{"text":"아프시다더니","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；다더니：引用以前听到的话，再说明后来的发现或结果。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프시다더니","audio":"/audio/01c9187e08697e10fb29.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아?","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c448a0eeb3883660a8a5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25377-1-13-2","ko":"응. 초기에 치료해서 다행히 많이 좋아지셨어.","zh":"嗯。因为早期就接受了治疗，幸好情况已经好很多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"초기에","meaning":"初期","explanation":"초기：初期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"초기","audio":"/audio/a3d559aa0f558891a804.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25377","senseId":"1","lemma":"초기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"초기에","audio":"/audio/f6f4ca33d76a32504480.mp3"}},{"text":"치료해서","meaning":"治疗","explanation":"치료하다：治疗；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"치료하다","audio":"/audio/0a612601f0e056bd7743.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72154","senseId":"1","lemma":"치료하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치료해서","audio":"/audio/ad8bb245fa40d631dc31.mp3"}},{"text":"다행히","meaning":"幸运，万幸，走运","explanation":"다행히：幸运，万幸，走运","readings":[{"term":"다행히","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23910","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다행히","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아지셨어.","meaning":"好，有益，有效；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아지셨어","audio":"/audio/85a7963313b48c96613c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"a3d559aa0f558891","term":"초기","zh":"初期","audio":"/audio/a3d559aa0f558891a804.mp3","entryId":"25377","definition":"开始的一段时间。","pronunciation":["초기"]},{"id":"0a612601f0e056bd","term":"치료하다","zh":"治疗","audio":"/audio/0a612601f0e056bd7743.mp3","entryId":"72154","definition":"治愈疾病或伤口等。","pronunciation":["치료하다"]},{"id":"7b75f0048465d767","term":"다행히","zh":"幸运，万幸，走运","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3","entryId":"23910","definition":"意外地运气好地。","pronunciation":["다행히"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/70cc8aa58035589b1632.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.076,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25377","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":112,"sequenceScore":2.9027,"questi